WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.524
[Background music]

1
00:00:01.525 --> 00:00:05.125
Hello and welcome to Hot Aisle Console.

2
00:00:06.165 --> 00:00:08.465
Sign in with your email.

3
00:00:12.268 --> 00:00:15.043
Approve the link in your browser.

4
00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:20.691
Create your team. Keep its compute and members together.

5
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.370
Add credits whenever you need them.

6
00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:33.697
Set up automatic rebill with a balance trigger, a top-up amount, and a monthly cap.

7
00:00:36.674 --> 00:00:42.474
Pick two MI300X GPUs and the vLLM image.

8
00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:46.901
Hold to launch. Status updates automatically.

9
00:00:48.878 --> 00:00:53.354
Connect over SSH. Follow running time and cost.

10
00:00:54.983 --> 00:00:57.983
Hold to release it and stop billing.

11
00:00:59.048 --> 00:01:01.948
Review the run in machine history.

12
00:01:03.115 --> 00:01:07.090
Make the console yours. Choose light or dark.

13
00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:12.617
Set a default image for your next machine.

14
00:01:15.827 --> 00:01:20.527
Hot Aisle Console, enterprise compute at your fingertips.
